  {"text":"All others are Counterfeite.","translation":"Все прочие — фальшивка.","where":"worlds/the-canterville-ghost/scenes/tapestry/elements/turnip.js"},
  {"text":"The Tapestry Chamber","translation":"Гобеленовая комната","where":"worlds/the-canterville-ghost/scenes/tapestry/scene.json title"},
  {"text":"Autumn, late in the afternoon. The door of the Tapestry Chamber stands ajar.","translation":"Осень, ближе к вечеру. Дверь Гобеленовой комнаты приоткрыта.","where":"worlds/the-canterville-ghost/scenes/tapestry/scene.json caption"}
